REM Protects GOTO/GOSUB/ON...GOSUB targets named after a language word (PRINT, SAVE, READ,
REM INPUT, FIND, EXTRACT, DELETE, ENTER, WRITE) from losing their branch-target linking, in
REM upper, lower and mixed case, including as the last item of a comma-separated target list.
GOSUB print
gosub save
GoSub read
GOSUB INPUT
gosub Find
GoSub EXTRACT
GOTO delete
goto enter
GoTo write
ON 1 GOSUB print,save
GOTO after
print: x = 1
RETURN
save: x = 2
RETURN
read: x = 3
RETURN
input: x = 4
RETURN
find: x = 5
RETURN
extract: x = 6
RETURN
delete: x = 7
RETURN
enter: x = 8
RETURN
write: x = 9
RETURN
after: y = 1
